<title>USA: FSF Financial gets repurchase approval.</title>
<headline>FSF Financial gets repurchase approval.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSF Financial Corp, the holding company of First Federal FSB, said Thursday it received approval from the U.S. Office of Thrift Supervision to repurchase up to five percent of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Beginning October 6, the company can buy back up to 173,884 shares. Shares are expected to be purchased in the open market during the next 12 months.</p>
<p>	  --Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
